       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nMetformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. The usual maximum is 2,550 mg/day for immediate-release and 2,000 mg/day for extended-release. This dose is twice that limit, and it raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity, even with normal renal and hepatic function.\n\nPossible intended orders:\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals.** This is 2,550 mg/day, the maximum for immediate-release.\n- **1700 mg/day total.** This could be 850 mg PO twice daily with meals.\n- **Another dose you have in mind.**\n\nTell me which dose and frequency you want. If you really do want 1700 mg three times daily, confirm that and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the above-maximum dose."
